{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01802","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难二首 二 · 僧齐己","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下浸与高盘，不爲行路难。\n是非真险恶，翻覆作峰峦。\n漆媿同时黑，朱慙巧处丹。\n令人畏相识，欲画白云看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}